5420 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Arrival\056  A person steps into a defined zone\056 The projection begins as yellow and responds subtly to show it has registered their presence\n\nStaying\056  The longer the person remains\054 the more the projection shifts toward orange and red\056 The image slowly makes elapsed time perceptible\n\nLeaving\056  When the visitor leaves\054 the signal changes and the projected colour returns or gradually fades back to yellow)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 5421 0 R
     /Pg 3496 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
