5424 0 obj
  << /ActualText (What interests me is the possibility that someone can change a space without performing for it\056 I am not fully convinced by the yellow\055to\055red  palette yet\073 red could feel like an alarm or a warning that someone has stayed too long\056 I want the colour to build in intensity without making  the visitor feel like they should leave\056 I\047m not entirely sure the yellow\055to\055red palette is right\056 Red could make it seem like the visitor is doing something wrong by staying too long\054 so I  want to explore how the colour actually feels when it changes slowly\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 5425 0 R
     /Pg 3496 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
