5449 0 obj
  << /ActualText (A motion\055triggered sensor might miss someone once they stop moving\056 A webcam using person\055detection software or a Kinect could be worth\015testing because the interaction depends on continued presence\054 not just movement\056 I also want to experiment with the timing\073 if the colour\015changes too slowly\054 someone might think it\047s a video playing on its own\056\015\nI\047d begin by checking whether the chosen setup can keep recognizing someone who stands still\056 Then I\047d compare a quick visual\015acknowledgement with a slower colour shift\054 and ask someone to try the projection without an explanation to see what they notice)
     /K [ 11 ]
     /P 5450 0 R
     /Pg 3908 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
