5508 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The class activities gave me a chance to try different hardware and software without having to settle on one idea right away\056 I was surprised by how many things could count as an input\056 After trying the examples and looking into responsive spaces\054 I became interested in an artwork that changes simply because someone is nearby)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 5509 0 R
     /Pg 5247 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

